3
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
At the start of World War I, Paul Baumer is a
young German patriot, eager to fight.

4
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:26,000
Indoctrinated with propaganda at school, he and his friends
eagerly sign up for the army soon after graduation.

5
00:41:40,000 --> 00:41:46,000
But when the horrors of war soon become too much to bear, and as his friends die or become gravely wounded,
Paul questions the sanity of fighting over a few hundreds yards of war-torn countryside.

